~ radio_dialogue
The radio on your desk crackles to life.
"Welcome, comrade, to your new vocation at the Ministry of Truth."
"Our role is to guide the public to the light of knowledge."
"Your weapon is your marker. You may find it on your desk... although it may be under today's clutter."
"Take your marker and strike through any errors you find. I trust, as a true-hearted member of the party, you will know truth from lie."
"When your judgement is through, place the files in the drawer on the top-left of your desk for your secretary to gather later."
"Go forth, my friend."
The radio fades into silence.
=> END